"{\"code\": \"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"><title>Minimalist Streetwear Collection | Generic Business</title><style>* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }body { font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; background: #ffffff; color: #2C2C2C; line-height: 1.6; }.container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; padding-bottom: 30px; }h1 { font-size: 48px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 10px; }.tagline { font-size: 16px; color: #666; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }.collection-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 40px; margin-bottom: 80px; }.product-card { background: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 8px; padding: 30px; text-align: center; }.product-card h3 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; margin: 20px 0; letter-spacing: 1px; }.product-image { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f5f5 0%, #ffffff 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 80px; margin-bottom: 20px; }.price { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 300; color: #2C2C2C; margin: 15px 0; }.description { font-size: 14px; color: #666; line-height: 1.6; margin: 15px 0; }.features { list-style: none; text-align: left; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #555; }.features li { padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; }.features li:before { content: \"✓ \"; color: #2C2C2C; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 8px; }.cta-button { display: inline-block; padding: 14px 40px; background: #2C2C2C; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; border: none; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 15px; transition: all 0.3s ease; }.cta-button:hover { background: #1a1a1a; transform: translateY(-2px); }.sticker-section { background: #f0f0f0; padding: 40px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 60px 0; text-align: center; }.sticker-section h2 { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 20px; letter-spacing: 1px; }.sticker-preview { width: 200px; height: 200px; margin: 30px auto; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, #f9f9f9 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 100px; }.marketing-section { margin: 60px 0; }.marketing-section h2 { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 30px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center; }.ad-copy { background: #2C2C2C; color: #fff; padding: 40px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; }.ad-copy h3 { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; }.ad-copy p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px; }.video-concept { background: #f9f9f9; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 30px; }.video-concept h4 { font-size: 18px; margin: 15px 0 10px 0; font-weight: 500; }.video-concept p { font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 10px; }footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 80px; padding-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; color: #999; font-size: 13px; }@media (max-width: 768px) { .collection-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }</style></head><body><div class=\"container\"><header><h1>MINIMALIST COLLECTION</h1><p class=\"tagline\">Streetwear Essentials for Modern Living</p></header><div class=\"collection-grid\"><div class=\"product-card\"><div class=\"product-image\">👕</div><h3>Essential Tee</h3><p class=\"price\">$35.00</p><p class=\"description\">Premium minimalist T-shirt with geometric line art design on 100% organic cotton.</p><ul class=\"features\"><li>100% Organic Cotton</li><li>Geometric Line Art</li><li>Unisex Fit XS–XXL</li><li>Sustainable Made</li></ul><a href=\"#checkout\" class=\"cta-button\">Add to Cart</a></div><div class=\"product-card\"><div class=\