video-concept\"><h4>📹 Promotional Video Concept</h4><p><strong>Title:</strong> \"The Essentials Collection – Minimalist Streetwear\"</p><p><strong>Duration:</strong> 30–60 seconds</p><p><strong>Scene 1 (0–10s):</strong> Close-up of geometric line art detail on black T-shirt, slow pan across fabric texture. Minimal background music begins.</p><p><strong>Scene 2 (10–20s):</strong> Model wearing complete outfit (tee, oxford shirt layered, cap). Walking through minimalist urban setting. Confidence-driven movement.</p><p><strong>Scene 3 (20–30s):</strong> Product flat-lay: T-shirt, cap, sticker pack arranged artfully. Quick cuts showing color options and details.</p><p><strong>Scene 4 (30–40s):</strong> Close-up of sticker pack and Oxford shirt buttons. Hand placing sticker on water bottle.</p><p><strong>Scene 5 (40–60s):</strong> Full lifestyle montage: wearing cap in café, sticker on laptop, oxford shirt in professional setting. Ends with all three products displayed. Text overlay: \"MINIMALIST COLLECTION – Shop Now\"</p><p><strong>Call-to-Action:</strong> \"Link in bio\" or direct Gumroad store URL</p><p><strong>Music:</strong> Subtle, modern, minimal electronic or indie folk track</p></div></div><footer><p>Generic Business © 2026 | Minimalist Streetwear | Sustainable Fashion</p><p>All products handcrafted with care. Ships worldwide.</p></footer></div></body></html>\", \"theme\": \"Minimalist Streetwear Collection – Essentials Series\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-30T22:22:02.207Z\"}"